{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"a4a4f8261d10e8d18b5bf1e9c888f39ee47970d68c428ace8a766f97419b1053","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_b925a595d4f1a46901088711e21b7b7c669a7dd0413ff116d3ed244c2bf47d5c","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical method for domain adaptation without a dedicated section for ethics, privacy, or broader societal impact. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine compliance with specific venue policies regarding anonymity, plagiarism, or mandatory impact statements, as no such policy documents or external overlap checks are available.","paper_id":"BJuysoFeg","paper_identity_sha256":"4bdf58dbde5187990292718805ae7994c46e67b176bd86e3b340a2ecdc34c58f","prompt_identity_sha256":"5e34969bab8e08945a67cc1f895b66d5c9d370157390859d0f4cf91b21960f85","raw_response_sha256":"5f8acc8d91b6165ba534df98dee9cca7119556b8a259b3af74b18dc545add783","request_identity_sha256":"bb359b2e1a6ef9ecaee90915e13675b7f9d521d0e7db516f666b16e78365d85c","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"84e2a12c3295618f3864afb04999e081a7373ae7ab62fc14b0d1a3c1caaa5ccf","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not contain a dedicated discussion of ethical risks, fairness, or potential harms associated with the proposed domain adaptation method. The application to cloud detection in remote sensing images is presented as a technical performance improvement without addressing potential dual-use scenarios or societal impacts. No specific ethical mitigation strategies are described in the text.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-012","SRC-018","SRC-031"],"review_text":"The paper utilizes several public datasets (ImageNet, Office-31, Caltech-Bing) and a self-collected remote sensing dataset. While the public datasets are standard benchmarks, the paper does not explicitly detail the licensing terms, consent protocols, or privacy compliance measures for the self-collected satellite imagery. There is no mention of data anonymization or specific adherence to privacy regulations for the remote sensing data.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper header explicitly lists the authors' names (Yanghao Li, Naiyan Wang, Jianping Shi, Jiaying Liu, Xiaodi Hou), their institutional affiliations (Peking University, TuSimple SenseTime), and their email addresses. Without a frozen venue policy confirming whether double-blind review was required or if these disclosures were permitted, it is not possible to declare a policy violation. However, the presence of this identifying information is noted.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The supplied evidence does not include external plagiarism checks, overlap analysis, or information regarding simultaneous submissions to other venues. Therefore, it is not possible to verify the originality of the content or to rule out dual submission based solely on the provided paper text.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not include a broader impact statement, a responsible AI checklist, or explicit documentation of IRB/ethics approvals. As no frozen policy obligation requiring these specific documents is provided in the evidence, the absence of these sections cannot be judged as a compliance failure, but the lack of such discussion is noted as a limitation in the provided text.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"9f507408ad71855bc6909fea236ed957345ed224e583f5090f1c1261f4ec823b","paper_id":"BJuysoFeg","paper_ordinal":40,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"5f8acc8d91b6165ba534df98dee9cca7119556b8a259b3af74b18dc545add783","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_